            "name": "derived_from_#",
            "mustBeNonEmpty": false,
            "documentation": "The subject_statement leaf(s) this value was COMPUTED from (its inputs). Present only on computed observations, whose subject_interaction.method names the algorithm. Typed to a statement leaf -- never an entity; the provenance inverse of directed_relation's entity->entity child/parent.",
