            "documentation": "The acquisition rig this observation was recorded on -- the DEVICE HALF of v1's `devicestring` (the name before the ':'), resolved against `acquisition_system.base.name`. OPTIONAL: present only on a recording observation decomposed from an ingested epoch's `epochprobemap` (did2.convert.resolveEpochProbemap); omitted when the device name resolves to no acquisition_system in the session, never emitted empty.",
            "must_refer_to_document_class": "acquisition_system"
        }
    ],
